sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI as npm start
    participant Orch as orchestrate.ts
    participant Config as config/goal.json
    participant LLM as LLM Client
    participant Agents as Agents (RA, Planner, Data)
    participant Exec as uiExecutor.ts
    participant PW as Playwright Sandbox
    participant Rep as reporter.ts

    CLI->>Orch: tsx orchestrate.ts
    Orch->>Config: Read testing goal
    Orch->>Agents: Trigger RequirementsAnalyst
    Agents->>LLM: Generate test scope
    LLM-->>Agents: JSON Response
    Orch->>Agents: Trigger TestPlanner
    Orch->>Agents: Trigger TestData
    Orch->>Exec: Dispatch UIExecutor
    Exec->>PW: Launch Headless Browser
    Exec->>LLM: Generate Playwright script
    LLM-->>Exec: Raw TS code
    Exec->>PW: Inject & execute code
    PW-->>Exec: Success or Crash
    Exec-->>Orch: Return execution status
    Orch->>Rep: Trigger Reporter
    Rep-->>Orch: Write /reports/summary.html
